From 2c2a46942f1af43cf887079e974857f5913ea520 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huawei <huawei@huawei.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Nov 2021 17:51:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH openEuler-1.0-LTS 1/3] EMMC: Ascend hisi customized emmc host

--------------------

To identify Ascend HiSilicon emmc chip, we add a customized property
to dts. In this patch we add an interface to read this property. At
the same time, we provided a switch, which is CONFIG_ASCEND_HISI_MMC,
for you to get rid of our modifications.

To support Ascend HiSilicon emmc chip, we add specific extensions in
mmc core, include mmc card sleep/awake/reset, cache ctrl, power vcc
adaptions and etc. Also, we enable some features for emmc5.0/5.1.

Modified mmc ops for Ascend HiSilicon emmc card because of the
difference bwteen our emmc card and others. we used customized
property in dts to judge if it is our chips. In this patch, we
modified emmc card init process, rate setting and ext_csd register
decode/encode. Modified sd suspend, resume, reset and init process
for ascend HiSilicon chip.

Signed-off-by: huawei <huawei@huawei.com>
